# The StudyMe server (backend/). Copy to .env and restart `npx expo start --clear`.
#
# Web (and the iOS simulator): the computer itself. Leave empty for http://localhost:4000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
#
# Phones (Expo Go) and the Android emulator. A phone can't reach "localhost" on your computer, and
# Google sign-in needs https, so use an ngrok tunnel to the server: `ngrok http --url=<domain> 4000`.
# Set backend/.env BETTER_AUTH_URL to the same address while testing on a phone.
# Empty → EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL (the Android emulator falls back to http://10.0.2.2:4000).
EXPO_PUBLIC_PHONE_API_URL=
